+Exchanges that quote in a subunit (LSE pence ``GBp``, JSE cents ``ZAc``, TASE agorot ``ILA``) are converted to the major unit, so every price changes by 100x and ``Repaired?`` is ``True`` on every row. ``Volume`` is deliberately left alone - a currency conversion does not change a share count. If the conversion cannot be checked against the live quote, a ``WARNING`` is logged naming the reason.
